[{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「啊、啊、啊啊啊——真的是舒服得让人不敢相信」","art":{"background":"a2216","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯……」","art":{"background":"a2216","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「感觉我的那里都麻得没感觉了……」","art":{"background":"a2216","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我也是。就像是还在紧紧夹住一样……啊啊，真的好厉害」","art":{"background":"a2216","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「――哈嚏」","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「芳乃，你冷吗？」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「毕竟光着身子嘛。而且，那个……还流了好多汗……」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a2048","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊，这……」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a2048","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"毕竟我们两人都特别兴奋。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"然后就这样去房间接着连战了。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"因为这个原因，睡衣都被汗水和粘液弄得黏糊糊的了。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"如果穿上的话更容易得感冒的。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「来，把这个穿上」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「哇……好宽松。你的衣服果然好大啊」","art":{"background":"a2219","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不过这样就不会感冒了吧？」","art":{"background":"a2219","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「是的。好温暖……呵呵呵」","art":{"background":"a2220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"芳乃光着身子披上我的衣服笑了。","art":{"background":"a2220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"……特别可爱。","art":{"background":"a2220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「今天的做爱好激烈……我都吓了一跳」","art":{"background":"a2221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯。而且舒服得我也吓到了」","art":{"background":"a2221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「这……全都是你的错哦」","art":{"background":"a2222","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「为什么怪我」","art":{"background":"a2222","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「还不是你教给了我的身体，那个……各种各样的快感，我才会变成这样的」","art":{"background":"a2221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「但是……你不是很喜欢那种舒服的感觉吗？」","art":{"background":"a2221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「这个，嗯……喜欢是喜欢……但我并不是喜欢舒服的感觉本身」","art":{"background":"a2223","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「我是喜欢和你一起享受这种舒服的感觉」","art":{"background":"a2222","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我知道的」","art":{"background":"a2222","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「想到只有我能让芳乃这样，我真的很开心」","art":{"background":"a2222","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「一产生舒服的感觉……就好像彼此的心意相通了一样」","art":{"background":"a2220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「所以，我们……下次再来一起享受吧……」","art":{"background":"a2221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「当然」","art":{"background":"a2221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"自不用她说，我也求之不得。","art":{"background":"a2221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……将臣」","art":{"background":"a2223","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯？」","art":{"background":"a2223","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「我爱你」","art":{"background":"a2221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……谢谢你。芳乃，我也爱你」","art":{"background":"a2221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「嗯，谢谢你，呵呵」","art":{"background":"a2220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「将臣」","art":{"background":"a2223","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯？」","art":{"background":"a2223","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「呵呵呵，抱歉。只是想叫叫你而已」","art":{"background":"a2221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「啊啊……只是叫你的名字，心里都感觉暖暖的」","art":{"background":"a2220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「用不着着急，今后还有很多机会呢」","art":{"background":"a2220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……是啊。因为我们永远都会在一起啊」","art":{"background":"a2220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「就是这样」","art":{"background":"a2220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「从今往后的人生里，就拜托你多多关照了」","art":{"background":"a2220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我才是要请你多关照」","art":{"background":"a2220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「哦，对了。有东西想给你」","art":{"background":"a2220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「给我？」","art":{"background":"a2224","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"那是在失去意识前，安晴叔叔给我的东西。","art":{"background":"a2224","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"对现在的我们来说正好用得上。","art":{"background":"a2224","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「那是……戒指吗？」","art":{"background":"a2222","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「是没错，但是抱歉。这不是我准备的」","art":{"background":"a2222","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「是吗？不过……那究竟是……？」","art":{"background":"a2224","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这是刚才安晴叔叔给我的」","art":{"background":"a2224","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「爸爸给的……吗？那，难道说――」","art":{"background":"a2224","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯。这是安晴叔叔和秋穗阿姨两人以前用过的戒指」","art":{"background":"a2224","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……爸爸……和妈妈……」","art":{"background":"a2221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「安晴叔叔说希望给我用」","art":{"background":"a2221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这似乎也是秋穗阿姨的愿望」","art":{"background":"a2221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「妈妈的愿望……是吗？」","art":{"background":"a2219","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"安晴","text":"「她说她只会哭，伤害到了女儿。所以她希望能留下让女儿幸福的东西。这是秋穗的愿望」","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[{"asset":"a359","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"安晴","text":"「如果在以前交给芳乃这个，这或许对她来说会是很大的负担。但现在的芳乃的话……」","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[{"asset":"a358","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「所以就交给了我。他说希望把这个给我用」","art":{"background":"a2223","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「而且我也会准备好另外的。现在……能请你接受吗？」","art":{"background":"a2223","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「妈妈……谢谢你」","art":{"background":"a2221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"芳乃接过戒指，套在自己的无名指上。","art":{"background":"a2221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"我也将另一个戒指套在手指上。","art":{"background":"a2221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「有点大啊」","art":{"background":"a2225","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我的也有点大」","art":{"background":"a2225","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「最好是重新改一下尺寸」","art":{"background":"a2225","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「不，没必要。这样就好了」","art":{"background":"a2226","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「你还会为我准备另外的吧？」","art":{"background":"a2225","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「当然。我肯定会准备的」","art":{"background":"a2225","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「那就够了。所以，妈妈的戒指保持这样就好了」","art":{"background":"a2225","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「………我知道了，就听你的吧」","art":{"background":"a2225","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「呵呵，我很期待」","art":{"background":"a2225","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「所以……让我们在一起吧。让我们在一起到天荒地老吧」","art":{"background":"a2227","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「当然！」","art":{"background":"a2227","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"只有芳乃，才会让我享受这样的恋情。","art":{"background":"a2227","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"我们发生了一生就仅此一次的邂逅。我绝对不会放弃这份幸福！","art":{"background":"a2227","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「让我们一起获得幸福吧」","art":{"background":"a2228","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"}]